  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ねむり姫』の絵本か。
悲しいお話で、あんまり
好きじゃないんだよなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is that a picture book of “Sleeping Beauty”? I never really liked that one. It's such a sad story.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつか落ちる……黒い……月……
……いつか……崩れる……白い月</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Ebony Moon... will one day tumble...
The Ivory Moon... will one day crumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はは……
そんなの、おとぎ話さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha. That's all just a fairy tale, you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつか落ちる……黒い月……
・怖がらなくていいんだよ
・月が落ちるはずないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Ebony Moon... will one day tumble...
・So there's nothing to be scared of.
・There's no way the moon could fall.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>怖がらなくていいんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So there's nothing to be scared of.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……怖い……って……何？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What does... scared mean...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『月が落ちる』なんて
あるはずないんだからさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way the moon could fall, that's just silly!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なんで……
そう……言える……の？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...How can... you be so sure?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……え!?
だって……そんな事が
起こるはずない……だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? I mean, there's just no way... right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
